/*
 * swos_amiga_data_stubs.c -- Auto-generated symbol stubs for the SDL build.
 *
 * The original Amiga SWOS2.s data section defined ~2200 globals (string
 * literals, lookup tables, BSS scratch buffers). Until each one is ported
 * to a real C definition we provide a zero-initialised placeholder of the
 * largest plausible size so the linker resolves the symbol.
 *
 * Sizes were harvested from `ds.b` directives in SWOS2.s where available;
 * everything else gets a generous 4 KiB blob.
 *
 * REGENERATE: re-run the awk pipeline in tools/gen_stubs.sh whenever the
 * link-time missing-symbol set changes.
 */

